sections.body:
- every connection is encrypted with HTTPS (TLS 1.2 or higher);
- passwords are hashed with argon2, two-factor secrets are encrypted, recovery codes are hashed;
- optional two-factor authentication works with any authenticator app, with an automatic lockout after repeated failed attempts;
- internal services live on an isolated private network and are reachable only through an authenticated gateway.
No system is perfectly secure: if a breach affects your data, we will notify you and the competent authority as the GDPR requires.

Under the GDPR you have the right to:
- **access** your data and receive a copy of it;
- **rectify** it: name and email can be edited directly from your profile;
- **erasure**, deleting your account and all associated data;
- **restrict** or **object to** processing based on legitimate interest;
- **data portability**, receiving your data in a structured, machine-readable format.
To exercise them, write to **privacy@smartbreeds.com** from the email address linked to your account: we will reply within 30 days. You can also lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority; in Italy, the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali (garanteprivacy.it).

When using SmartBreeds you agree not to:
- upload content that is illegal, violent, sexually explicit or offensive, or that violates the rights of others; an automatic filter rejects inappropriate images;
- upload photos you have no rights to, or photos of people;
- try to access other users' accounts or data, or circumvent security measures and rate limits;
- send bulk requests with bots, scrapers or other automated tools, or overload the infrastructure;
- reverse engineer the service or use it to build a competing product;
- use the service for any unlawful purpose.
